 things. I realize I can accept both claims. There are plenty of unused tokens, so I don't need to worry too much. I just need to be confident in my approach.","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.summary","summary":"**Clarifying coding semantics**\n\nI’m thinking about how coding tasks often use claims about experiences and consciousness. It seems like they can be semantically equivalent, but I notice that saying \"I experience faint feeling\" doesn’t quite prove consciousness. Here, I might have two distinct subjects with the same polarity at the same time, but they target different things. I realize I can accept both claims. There are plenty of unused tokens, so I don't need to worry too much. I just need to be confident in my approach.","format":"azure-openai-responses-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABqw8La1-Cr3cdUMirUtykuB6BBzODHEC4sKLIsssBCAOJzQLEvP2zO8oqA60TsjKDWYw-aM0YmP0AkhcuCf8K3x83184figQKoCK7ElBE-uU4TNhpCl8y8Fhxnsz4PRigX1YUGSSCZmtSC87JppQF_yzooNEgEh-BujoQL5O6hHIOU02rp_F9UUWL9eT6waCCmIzWTp7l8sfI0tWUy-g4DqKoUtE7PTDFxO7tBaJ_0Ym5u4YsXPeXd9HfkLJDDYw1i6SadRkuWYG7nwFRmYIoM9dhbhDRAIVwK70835KHbcA7lAbN-oV50msfJ5mfbZAdvphzTcGbZB2z4d10_aG65Z3Z_g8LwOYGfnMQpWh2xBeG0PhvyDNLfFWXY77AaCeyJoNQQXNKYqZY-HCQ6Kb16DTlSnSH_V50fhLJSIGx95GNYBRboffM-DCQQlKEamK1ClrhhSP7s87Dvqf-ElJ7yxjV8L_gT1dISbv53eFGqeq7dFDuT1fBPNYARKZG1T-EY7UAtnrA1akx7nvOE-QIBJBKKGv0b1LjQxBp5Xddry6HvKrEgovO-jWOr2NoRx-RVZXSClS3Dzp-1MZuIFHD5XUXcbCwnpult9-TlKpG2t2sTpltWHg-wie5trJojt875T0eH-l0tqg4OlZwV5qdavdogQbt8SrAXRGK29COSCFIvq3lWXDgokHSj4Z1JNGsiFungT-fVv-xMMkI2uXJ1fS6X9F6oyrHa0DD4VkQcbxCgiU6d6nNBiJf5lyWqOpL17PWNBn4cd-0p0runhCagx1XgWMP70gGJWSs3cOytUhK6pPObKefAXJlcShV57YTfbye4tBgPYNp0XVjqohmY-Fy2x0MirPtTkgBw6fWUUPji13NUQOL-anrc93VGCem2_6jB9FFJOd1yt6uKT7s6yt1QA7iRTO9EjvckPHqxIS3vJjz1zwmVyuc7lYhmEaqOPDhbuVf2RiuV9aF0oG4V7YLAu4BeoMcItoxUUC77dsmKj5cacvaK1Ik530cXsDVTHGgTZ_WqFevSzmkd-3XaL614ZDEmzYjQOQKWHT5op67unsdss5HBO2imz471xHJzg1ZBm3-yYhwYSZBj3V4Rm72niJ64N5wlVc06YHD_DeAPXHw-HinV6y5Mw5owHIAZ